graph TD
    %% Estilos globais
    classDef db fill:#2d3748,stroke:#4a5568,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef queue fill:#2c5282,stroke:#3182ce,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef worker fill:#744210,stroke:#d69e2e,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef api fill:#1a365d,stroke:#2b6cb0,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;

    Client[Client / Frontend] -->|POST /evaluations| API[API Controller & Service]

    subgraph Monolith ["monitor-server-v2 (Main App Monolith)"]
        API -->|Transaction ACID| PG[(PostgreSQL OLTP)]
        Outbox[Outbox Table & Relay] -->|Polls & Dispatches| PG
        
        %% Ingestor interno na app principal
        Stream[(Redis Stream Buffer)]:::queue -->|Batch Sealing / Timeout| Batch[Batch Ingestion Worker]
        Batch -->|Insert w/ Dedup Token| CH[(ClickHouse OLAP)]:::db
    end

    Outbox -->|Deterministic jobId| BullMQ[(BullMQ / Redis Queue)]:::queue

    subgraph WorkerCluster ["Isolated Evaluation Worker Microservice (1 to N Containers)"]
        BullMQ -->|Distributes Jobs| W1[Worker Instance A]:::worker
        BullMQ -->|Distributes Jobs| W2[Worker Instance B]:::worker
        BullMQ -->|Distributes Jobs| WN[Worker Instance N]:::worker
        
        W1 -->|Uploads Artifact| S3[(S3 Object Storage)]:::db
        W2 -->|Uploads Artifact| S3
        WN -->|Uploads Artifact| S3
        
        W1 -->|Updates Status = COMPLETED| PG
        W2 -->|Updates Status = COMPLETED| PG
        WN -->|Updates Status = COMPLETED| PG
        
        W1 -->|XADD Metrics Payload| Stream
        W2 -->|XADD Metrics Payload| Stream
        WN -->|XADD Metrics Payload| Stream
    end